{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09207","headline":"清都观荅幼遐 · 韦应物","name":"清都观荅幼遐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逍遥仙家子，日夕朝玉皇。\n兴高清露没，渴饮琼华浆。\n解组一来款，披衣拂天香。\n粲然顾我笑，绿简发新章。\n泠泠如玉音，馥馥若兰芳。\n浩意坐盈此，月华殊未央。\n却念諠譁日，何由得清凉。\n疎松抗高殿，密竹阴长廊。\n荣名等粪土，携手随风翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}